the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Antrag holds for *a case*.
    the answer to Antrag for *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Antrag would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_7_accept_time_bounds_without_offset includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-time-bounds-without-offset.ruml".

Antrag holds for a case if
    the answer to Antrag for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Antrag holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Antrag for the case is a truth value
    and Antrag would hold for the case.

